          <Pad Id="OoBe3p55vLC7Kd4nISmAEW" Bounds="60,95,1700,40" ShowValueBox="true" isIOBox="true" Value="All three columns end in the same Feature, and the shape of the patch is the same: geometry, the attributes, one node that puts them together, one node that takes them apart. Only the middle differs. Left: one Add per attribute. Middle: a table, no schema. Right: a schema - a record that is the feature.">
